id: pm-vcs-dzz3
title: Review state as a record that merges per field
description: "Review state is a record that merges per field so two reviewers writing different fields concurrently never conflict. Prove it by merging two real branches that both wrote review state, asserting both survive, and that a genuinely conflicting single field is still reported as a conflict."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-28T13:43:07.406Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-28T20:11:18.324Z"
